        <mxCell id="v33" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation (UML 2.5).&lt;/b&gt; Stick figure = actor outside the system; ellipse = use case; box = system boundary; plain line = association; hollow triangle = generalisation (Borrower and Lender are Booking parties, the primary actor of B12); dashed open arrow = &amp;#171;include&amp;#187; (always happens: B5 step 5, B12 step 4) or &amp;#171;extend&amp;#187; (conditional, from the extending use case to the base use case's extension point: B7 ext 3a, B8 ext 3a, D3/4/5 ext 4a).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not actors:&lt;/b&gt; the Trust Engine (Module 5) is part of the system; its use cases run through &amp;#171;include&amp;#187;/&amp;#171;extend&amp;#187;. D6 hands a case to I4 at D6 step 3 (no UML relationship). Colour = module: blue 3, green 5, orange 9." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
